"italic\":true}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\". \",\"style\":{\"italic\":true}}}],\"style\":{}}}}}","textOnly":"Trade on-the-go with Binance’s crypto trading app (iOS/Android)Find us on TelegramWhatsAppXFacebookInstagramDiscordBinance reserves the right in its sole discretion to amend or cancel this announcement at any time and for any reasons without prior notice.Disclaimer: In compliance with MiCA requirements, from 2024-06-30, unauthorized stablecoins are subject to certain restrictions for EEA users. For more information, please click here. Digital asset prices can be volatile. The value of your investment can go down or up and you may not get back the amount invested. You are solely responsible for your investment decisions and Binance is not liable for any losses you may incur. Futures trading, in particular, is subject to high market risk and price volatility. All of your Margin Balance may be liquidated in the event of adverse price movement. Past performance is not a reliable predictor of future performance. Before trading, you should make an independent assessment of the appropriateness of the transaction in light of your own objectives and circumstances, including the risks and potential benefits. Consult your own advisers, where appropriate. This information should not be construed as financial or investment advice.To learn more about how to protect yourself, visit our Responsible Trading resource page. For more information, see our Terms of Use, Exchange Rules, Clearing Rules, Exchange Procedures, Clearing Procedures, relevant Contract Specifications and Risk Warning.","deleted":1,"footStatus":1,"useCount":0},"contentJson":"{\"layout\":{\"root\":[\"ViewInstance0\"],\"ViewInstance0\":[\"f8fff112-d5ad-44f2-b9d1-b094c8decacb\",\"9a4898e2-b982-41c5-bcfe-033ea64b859f\",\"aad54709-e2bf-4443-b9d4-40815376293f\",\"cf5706b5-58c6-4bbb-a160-ac793c0ef699\",\"33494336-93a6-4f4c-a37d-4816a43f13a5\",\"825ab8d9-dade-4ca6-a981-9de12cd932c9\",\"bd4cc769-40bb-42c6-90bd-d00ea99c02b6\",\"7d3cb163-0cfd-4725-964a-99559b1273ad\",\"f63fcccc-78a1-4685-b2d0-f245fd297185\",\"d13d851a-1a86-4d89-94be-2180df73c917\",\"b411308b-c75c-48ea-944c-b52bd71e82c2\",\"41471245-8deb-42eb-9fba-f80d3fe07213\"]},\"hash\":{\"ViewInstance0\":{\"id\":\"Fragment\"},\"f8fff112-d5ad-44f2-b9d1-b094c8decacb\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"This is a general announcement. Products and services referred to here may not be available in your region.\",\"style\":{\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"9a4898e2-b982-41c5-bcfe-033ea64b859f\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"Fellow Binancians,\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"aad54709-e2bf-4443-b9d4-40815376293f\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"In order to improve users trading experience, Binance will adjust the Futures settlement price calculation at \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"2024-11-11 08:00 (UTC)\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\". It will use the average of the price index every second over the last 30 minutes (between 07:30 and 08:00 UTC) before delivery, i.e., a total of 1,800 price indices.\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"cf5706b5-58c6-4bbb-a160-ac793c0ef699\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"Please note that the change \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"will affect\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\" the settlement price calculation for both \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextLink\",\"config\":{\"href\":\"https://www.%suffixOrigin%/%locale%/support/faq/delivery-and-settlement-of-quarterly-futures-a3401595e1734084959c61491bc0dbe3\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"content\":\"delivery contracts\",\"customEvents\":{},\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(17, 85, 204)\",\"underscore\":true}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\" and any contracts that are subject to \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextLink\",\"config\":{\"href\":\"https://www.%suffixOrigin%/%locale%/support/faq/delisting-of-futures-contracts-dd60dfbf654d4055aa6b217ea6d5ddba\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"content\":\"delisting\",\"customEvents\":{},\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(17, 85, 204)\",\"underscore\":true}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\". \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"33494336-93a6-4f4c-a37d-4816a43f13a5\":{\"id\":\"RichTextHeader\",\"config\":{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"Existing Futures Settlement Price Calculation \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}]}},\"825ab8d9-dade-4ca6-a981-9de12cd932c9\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"The settlement price used for delivery of contracts will be calculated as the average of the price index every second over the last hour (between 07:00 and 08:00 UTC) before delivery, i.e., a total of 3,600 price indices.\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"bd4cc769-40bb-42c6-90bd-d00ea99c02b6\":{\"id\":\"RichTextHeader\",\"config\":{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"New Futures Settlement Price Calculation \",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}]}},\"7d3cb163-0cfd-4725-964a-99559b1273ad\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"The settlement price used for delivery of contracts will be calculated as the average of the price index every second over the last 30 minutes (between 07:30 and 08:00 UTC) before delivery, i.e., a total of 1,800 price indices.\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"f63fcccc-78a1-4685-b2d0-f245fd297185\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"Note:\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}},{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\" There may be discrepancies between this original content in English and any translated versions. Please refer to the original English version for the most accurate information, in case any discrepancies arise.\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"d13d851a-1a86-4d89-94be-2180df73c917\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"Thank you for your support!\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"b411308b-c75c-48ea-944c-b52bd71e82c2\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"Binance Team\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}},\"41471245-8deb-42eb-9fba-f80d3fe07213\":{\"id\":\"RichTextParagraph\",\"config\":{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"RichTextText\",\"config\":{\"content\":\"2024-11-04\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":\"justify\"}}}}}","pairs":[],"lastUpdateTime":0},"success":true}